            <ArticleTitle>&quot;Black hole&quot; restenosis after sirolimus-eluting stent implantation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E253-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In several reports, the &quot;black hole&quot; (BH) phenomenon was reported as a homogeneous echolucent appearance by intravascular ultrasound. We discuss an experience with angioscopic and pathological assessment for the BH phenomenon.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
